{"file": "天灾末世，她囤满物资后所向披靡！-第487集.mp4", "ep": 487, "duration": 42.2, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 1.6, "text": "我老婆孩子还在等我"}, {"start": 1.6, "end": 3.4, "text": "你这个坏东西"}, {"start": 3.4, "end": 5.52, "text": "又要抢走我儿子"}, {"start": 5.52, "end": 22.33, "text": "没门"}, {"start": 22.33, "end": 23.29, "text": "曹大神"}, {"start": 23.29, "end": 25.17, "text": "放我们出去"}, {"start": 25.17, "end": 30.26, "text": "原来你也是个坏的"}, {"start": 30.26, "end": 31.5, "text": "乖乖听话"}, {"start": 31.5, "end": 32.94, "text": "让所有人离开"}, {"start": 32.94, "end": 33.78, "text": "要不然"}, {"start": 33.78, "end": 39.61, "text": "我就不客气了"}, {"start": 39.61, "end": 40.65, "text": "我要出去"}, {"start": 40.65, "end": 41.81, "text": "可是"}, {"start": 41.81, "end": 42.21, "text": "万"}]}